    <h2 class="doc_title">M/S Vardhman Ispat Udyog vs Himachal Pradesh State Electricity ... on 23 December, 2024</h2>

<h3 class="doc_author">Author: <a href="https://indiankanoon.org/search/?formInput=authorid:s-sharma">Sandeep Sharma</a></h3>

<h3 class="doc_bench">Bench: <a href="https://indiankanoon.org/search/?formInput=benchid:s-sharma">Sandeep Sharma</a></h3>

<p data-structure="Issue" id="p_1">                                                         2024:HHC:15726




     IN THE HIGH COURT OF HIMACHAL PRADESH, SHIMLA

                            CWP No. 4345 of 2023 a/w CWP Nos.
