            shall not be liable to furnish security as contemplated under Clause
</blockquote><blockquote id="blockquote_69">            (a) of Sub-section (1) of <a href="https://indiankanoon.org/doc/60777736/" id="a_124">Section 47</a>. It was noticed that if the
            consumer is prepared to take the supply through a pre-paid meter,
